(1082, 'Aklan Electric Cooperative, Inc.', 'Network Service Provider\'s Monthly Customer Information and Metering Compliance Report (NSP Reportorial Form 1)', 'Reviewed by: Corporate Planning Division Manager', 'Noted by:  General Manager', '1. 1. ERC Resolution No. 24 series of 2011 - A Resolution Adopting the      Revised Uniform Repartorial Requrement (URR) by all Distribution Utilites		\n2. 2. Republic Act No. 9136 - The Department of Energy Act of 1902		\n3. 3. ERC Resolution No. 08, Series of 2021 - A Resolution Adopting the      Rules for the Green Energy Option Program (GEOP)		\n4. 4 ERC Resolution No. 12, series of 2020 - A Resolution Prescribing the     Timeline for the Implementation of Retail Competition and Open Access      (RCOA)		\n5. 5. DOE DC 2015-04-0002 - Directing All Generation Companies, Distibution      Utilities and Independent Power Producer Adminstrators to submit to the      Department of Energy Reportorial Requirements and other Pertinent      Data as may be required for the formulation of the Power Supply and      Demand Forecasts of the Power Development Plan		\n6. 6. DOE DC 2018-02-0003- Adopting and Prescribing the Policy for the     Competitive Selection Process in the Procurement by the Distribution     Utilities of Power Supply Agreement for the Captive Market		\n7. 7. DOE Advisory 2022 on Renewable Portfolio Standard		\n8. 8. DOE DC2017-12-0015- Promulgating the Rules and Guidelines      Governing the Establishments of the Renewable Profolio Standards for      On-Grid Areas		\n9. 9. ERC Resolution No. 06, Series of 2019 - A Resolution Adopting the      Amendments to the Rules Enabling the Net Metering Program for      Renewable Energy		\n10. 10. ERC Resolution No. 17, Series of 2023 - A Resolution Adopting the        2023 Revised Rules for the Issuance of Certiicale of Compliance for        Generation Facilites		\n11. 11. ERC Resolution No. 23, Series of 2007 - A Resolution Adopting the        Policy that the Grant of Preferential Rates to Qualited Customers shall        be considered as Management Prerogatives		\n12. 12. ERC Resolution No. 14, Series of 2022- A Resolution Adopting the        Revised Rules Covering the Automatic Cost Adjustment and True-Up        Mechanisms and Corresponding Confirmation Process for Distribution        Utilities		\n13. 13. ERC Resolution No. 13 Series of 2024 - A Resolution Adopting the        Omnibus Rules for the Customer Choice Programs in the Retail Market		\n14. 14. ERC Resolution No. 13, series of 2025: A Resolution Providing for the        Guidelines Establishing an Enhanced Mandatory Regulatory Education        Program (EMREP) and Providing Qualifications, Functions, and        Certification of Regulatory Compliance Officers (RCOs)		', 'uploads/69796ac38fcf7_1769564867_0.pdf', 'Appendix B_AKELCO MANAP Compilation FINAL.pdf', '2026-01-28 01:47:47', '2026-01-28 08:46:00', 'B', '1. OFFICE OF THE GENERAL MANAGER / CORPORATE PLANNING DIVISION (CPD)'),
