(1462, 'Batangas I Electric Cooperative, Inc.', 'DU Form 1 - Affidavit of Capacity and Energy Allocations by Distribution Utility (DU)', '', 'General Manager', '1. 1. ERC Resolution No. 5, Series of 2013, A Resolution on Disclosure of Capacity and Energy Allocations by Distribution Utilities in the Luzon and Visayas Grids  and Retail Electricity Suppliers		\n2. 2. ERC Resolution No. 16 Series of 2009, to be submitted to the ERC in Accordance with Resolution No. 24, Series of 2011, A Resolution Adopting the Rules Governing the Automatic Cost Adjustment and True-Up Mechanisms and Corresponding Confirmation Process for Distribution Utilities		\n3. 3. ERC Resolution No. 5 Series of 2007, Resolution Directing All Distribution Utilities to Post in their Respective Websites the Breakdown of their Generation Charges, including but not limited to their sources		\n4. 4. R.A. 10531, DC2013-07-0015_IRR_NEA, NEA Memo 2014-17 ,Prescribing the Implementing Rules and Regulations of Republic Act No. 10531, Otherwise Known as the National Electrification Administration Reform Act of 2013		\n5. 5. ERC Resolution No. 16 Series of 2009, to be submitted to the ERC in Accordance with Resolution No. 24, Series of 2011, A Resolution Adopting the Rules Governing the Automatic Cost Adjustment and True-Up Mechanisms and Corresponding Confirmation Process for Distribution Utilities		\n6. 6. NEA Memorandum 2018-051 dated August 07, 2018 System Procedure in the Implementation of the NEA Bit in compliance with RA 10531		\n7. 7. DOE Department Circular No. 2013-05-006, Enjoining All Generation  Companies,  Distribution Utilities, Suppliers and Local Suppliers to Ensure an Effective and  Successful Transition Towards the Implementation of Retail Competition and Open  Access		\n8. 8. DOE Department Circular No. DC2017-12-0015, Promulgating the Rules and Guidelines Governing the Establishment of the Renewable Portfolio Standards for On-Grid Areas		\n9. 9. Compliance as Direct WESM Member using Central Registration and Settlement System (CRSS)		\n10. 10. ERC Resolution No. 24, Series of 2011 and ERC Resolution No. 1, Series of 2012 as amended by ERC Resolution No. 14, Series of 2022		\n11. 11. DOE Circular No. 2023-03-0005 Providing Supplemental Policy for the systematic Management of the DOE Reportorial Requirements for Electric Power Industry Participants- Distribution Utilities		', 'uploads/6979a86f49890_1769580655_0.pdf', 'MANAP_BATELEC.pdf', '2026-01-28 06:10:55', '2026-01-30 05:56:37', 'B', '1. CORPORATE PLANNING DEPARTMENT / PLANNING AND UTILITY ECONOMICS DIVISION'),
