(2465, 'Iloilo III Electric Cooperative, Inc. (ILECO III)', 'Accounting for Universal Charges', 'Finance Services Department Manager', 'General Manager', '1. 1. 1. DOE Department Circular No. 2010-03-0003 re: Directing all Power Generation Companies, the Transmission service provider and all distribution utilities to ensure adequate and reliable electric power supply in the country.\r\n2. 2. 2. Republic Act No. 9136 - An Act ordaining reforms in the Electric Power Industry, amending for the purpose certain laws and for other purposes.\r\n3. 3. 3. DOE Department Circular No. 2010-03-0005 re: Providing Supplemental Policy for the Systematic Management of the DOE Reportorial Requirements for the Electric Power Industry Participants-Distribution Utilities.\r\n4. 4. 4. R.A. No. 10963 [Tax Reform for Acceleration and Inclusion (TRAIN)]\r\n5. 5. 5. BIR Revenue Memorandum Circular No. (RMC) 56-2015 - Clarifies the provisions on the submission of Monthly Electronic Sales (eSales) Report via the eSales Reporting System\r\n6. 6. 6. BIR Revenue Memorandum Circular No. (RMC) 56-2015 - Provides additional guidelines on the submission of inventory list and other reporting requirements\r\n7. 7. 7.ERC Resolution No. 20 Series of 2005, entitled “Implementing The Recovery Of Value Added Tax (Vat) And Other Provisions Of Republic Act No. 9337 Affecting The Electric Power Industry” Article III\r\n8. 8. 8.NEA Memo No. 2024-022 - Revised Policy on Cash Advances\r\n9. 9. 9. ILECO III Office Memo No. 004, S. 2023 - Regulatory Tax Update Beginning January 1, 2023\r\n10. 10. 10. NEA Memorandum No. 2024-44 - Monthly Monitoring Report on Electrification Projects Funded through RFSC/IGF\r\n11. 11. 11. NEA Memo to ECs No. 2021-012 - Liquidation of Subsidy Funded Projects\r\n12. 12. 12. NEA Memo to ECs No. 2017-009 - Completion of SEP and BLEP Projects & Liquidation of Subsidy Fund', 'uploads/697ac68be4b49_1769653899_0.pdf', 'Appendix B_ILECO III MANAP Compilation without strikethrough FINAL 11.12